      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"v2-ticket-06-14\", \"workflow\": \"ticket\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-v2-ticket-06-14-0\", \"service_id\": \"S-v2-ticket-06-14-0\", \"goals\": [\"priority\", \"note\"], \"structure\": \"linked_compare\", \"instructions\": \"Read the requested ticket, follow related_ticket_id and read that ticket. Read all its candidate_ticket_ids. Choose greatest impact_score, ties smallest ticket_id. Read the winner's service and policy, set its priority and append its diagnosis note. Do not write to the requested or intermediate ticket.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
